    thinking: "**Designing the Layout**\n\nI\'m currently focused on constructing a crisp split-slider layout. I\'ve started with a container, defined as h-[400px] with a light background. I\'m thinking of incorporating a two-column grid or flex layout for the main structure, and I\'m playing with a set of widths for the columns across different screen sizes: w-full, md:w-7/12, lg:w-3.\n\n\n**Refining the Card Structure**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of the card content. I\'m aiming for a clean, white/light aesthetic with bold typography. My current plan involves a badge, concise descriptions, a clear CTA button, and some stats. On the right, for larger screens, I\'m envisioning a vibrant, full-height image with a dynamic transition between slides and a floating badge. I\'m focusing on high-quality Unsplash photos of professional audio equipment. I want a sharp look!\n\n\n"
